From a91797f65e2ec7f1f28bd7c4d71ee60678568857 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Albert <albert@tugraz.at>
Date: Sun, 9 Nov 2025 15:04:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fortran: Fix DO CONCURRENT resolution and constraint
 enforcement

This patch fixes the resolution of DO CONCURRENT constructs and improves
code quality in Jerry DeLisle's type-spec implementation.

Key changes in resolve.cc:
1. Set gfc_do_concurrent_flag=1 before calling gfc_resolve_forall to
   enable proper constraint checking during body resolution (F2008 C1139:
   only PURE procedures allowed in DO CONCURRENT)
2. Set gfc_do_concurrent_flag=2 after resolution to distinguish mask
   context from block context for appropriate error messages
3. Add NULL pointer checks for shadow variables from DO CONCURRENT
   type-spec which may not have symtree initialized yet
4. Update gfc_count_forall_iterators to handle both EXEC_FORALL and
   EXEC_DO_CONCURRENT for proper nested construct iterator counting
5. Fix initialization condition to check both forall_save==0 and nvar==0
   to prevent incorrect total_var recalculation in nested constructs
6. Skip FORALL obsolescence warning for DO CONCURRENT constructs
7. Suppress FORALL many-to-one assignment warning for DO CONCURRENT
   since reduction-like operations are semantically valid (formalized
   with REDUCE locality-spec in Fortran 2023)

Code quality improvements in match.cc:
8. Improve error diagnostics with descriptive messages
9. Eliminate code duplication by extracting apply_typespec_to_iterator
   helper function (removed ~70 lines of duplicated code)

Shadow variable implementation in resolve.cc:
10. Implement shadow variable substitution walker to replace Jerry's
    placeholder fatal error. The walker recursively visits all expressions
    in the DO CONCURRENT body and replaces references to outer scope
    variables with their shadow counterparts (created with _ prefix).

gcc/fortran/ChangeLog:

	* match.cc (apply_typespec_to_iterator): New helper function.
	Consolidates shadow variable creation logic previously duplicated
	for first and subsequent iterators.
	(match_forall_header): Replace duplicated shadow variable creation
	with calls to apply_typespec_to_iterator. Improve error messages.
	* resolve.cc (replace_in_expr_recursive): New function. Recursively
	walks expressions to replace symbol references.
	(replace_in_code_recursive): New function. Recursively walks code
	blocks to replace symbol references.
	(gfc_replace_forall_variable): New function. Entry point for shadow
	variable substitution.
	(gfc_resolve_assign_in_forall): Skip many-to-one assignment warning
	for DO CONCURRENT.
	(gfc_count_forall_iterators): Add gcc_assert for both EXEC_FORALL
	and EXEC_DO_CONCURRENT. Handle both construct types.
	(gfc_resolve_forall): Skip F2018 obsolescence warning for
	DO CONCURRENT. Check both forall_save==0 and nvar==0 before
	allocating var_expr array. Add NULL checks for shadow variables.
	Implement shadow variable walker to replace placeholder fatal error.
	(gfc_resolve_code): Set gfc_do_concurrent_flag=1 before calling
	gfc_resolve_forall, then set to 2 after.
